## Mindris AI — Ollama Modelfile
## Creates a gemma4 variant with a 32 768-token context window.
##
## USAGE (run this once from a Windows terminal):
##
##   ollama create gemma4:32k -f gemma4-32k.modelfile
##
## Then update .env:
##   OPENAI_MODEL_NAME="gemma4:32k"
##
## After this, the `extra_body` trick in llm_config.py is no longer needed
## (though it is harmless to keep as a safety net).

FROM gemma4:latest

## Raise the KV-cache context window to 32 768 tokens.
## This is the ONLY reliable way to change the context length:
## setting it per-request via options.num_ctx works only if the model
## was *loaded* with enough KV cache already allocated.
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768

## Keep sampling parameters consistent with the base model defaults.
PARAMETER temperature 1
PARAMETER top_k 64
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
